  "protocol": "Trade On Orion",
  "name": "Trade On Orion stake-release liability desynchronization",
  "summary": "requestReleaseStake() credited staked ORN back to the exchange balance without reconciling the liabilities list. Cycling lockStake, a self-signed redeemAtomic and requestReleaseStake left stale ORN liability entries, so calcPosition counted a later positive ORN balance again as collateral and the attacker borrowed and withdrew every exchange asset.",
